OL,3,GNEWSAExpelled councillor vows 'I will
OL,4,Aalways be Labour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor says "everything about me,
OL,7,Feverything I do is Labour" despite
OL,8,Fbeing forced out of the party after
OL,9,Fmore than 50 years.
OL,11,FRicky Rogers, the only Labour voice on
OL,12,FWiltshire Council, was expelled from
OL,13,Fthe party by its national executive
OL,14,Fcommittee (NEC) after forming a
OL,15,Fcoalition with a independent councillor
OL,16,Fin a bid to bring motions forward for
OL,17,Fcouncil consideration.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
