OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAExpelled councillor vows 'I will
OL,4,Aalways be Labour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepresenting his home ward of Fisherton
OL,7,Fand Bemerton in Salisbury since 1987,
OL,8,FRogers, who will now sit as an
OL,9,Findependent, said he was hoping the NEC
OL,10,Fwould have "a bit of flexibility and
OL,11,Funderstanding".
OL,13,FLabour Party spokesperson said the
OL,14,Fparty "does not comment on its internal
OL,15,Fdisciplinary processes".
